  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Partner: We Reach Community Based Organization Project Title: &apos; Addressing domestic violence amid the COVID19 crisis among young women&apos;Project Objective: To create a champions network of domestic violence survivors among young women in Lurambi Sub County and to improve the livelihoods of young women domestic violence survivors in Lurambi Sub County within six months.Project Activities: Sensitization of women on domestic violence, creation of  a response and prevention network, training women on hand-washing soap making and support 50 selected women to start up soap making businesses</narrative>
  </description>
